beats.content:
`settings.layout` holds two widths:

- `contentSize` is the default width of content, such as the text of a post. For comfortable reading, aim for roughly 45 to 75 characters per line.
- `wideSize` is the width of blocks set to "wide" alignment. It should be bigger than `contentSize`, but not the full screen, because "full" alignment already covers that.

```json
"settings": {
  "layout": {
    "contentSize": "40rem",
    "wideSize": "64rem"
  }
}
```

Both take any CSS length, like `rem`, `px` or `%`. `layout` sits inside `settings`, next to `color`. It is not a top-level key.

files.theme.json:
{
  "$schema": "https://schemas.wp.org/trunk/theme.json",
  "version": 3,
  "settings": {
    "useRootPaddingAwareAlignments": true,
    "color": {
      "palette": [
        { "name": "Base", "slug": "base", "color": "#ffffff" },
        { "name": "Contrast", "slug": "contrast", "color": "#1e1e1e" },
        { "name": "Subtle", "slug": "subtle", "color": "#f0f0f0" },
        { "name": "Accent", "slug": "accent", "color": "#3858e9" }
      ]
    },
    "layout": {
      "contentSize": "40rem",
      "wideSize": "64rem"
    },
    "typography": {
      "fontFamilies": [
        {
          "name": "System Sans",
          "slug": "system-sans",
          "fontFamily": "system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif"
        }
      ]
    }
  },
  "styles": {
    "color": {
      "background": "var:preset|color|base",
      "text": "var:preset|color|contrast"
    },
    "spacing": {
      "padding": {
        "top": "0",
        "right": "1.5rem",
        "bottom": "0",
        "left": "1.5rem"
      }
    },
    "typography": {
      "fontFamily": "var:preset|font-family|system-sans",
      "lineHeight": "1.6"
    },
    "elements": {
      "link": {
        "color": { "text": "var:preset|color|accent" }
      },
      "heading": {
        "typography": { "fontWeight": "700", "lineHeight": "1.2" }
      }
    }
  },
  "templateParts": [
    { "name": "header", "title": "Header", "area": "header" },
    { "name": "footer", "title": "Footer", "area": "footer" }
  ]
}
